/-!
# Point maps for the HS conjugate certificate

The packed maps below are checked on every point against the actual carrier
letters and the marked word `t`. They support the five-point certificates
for 15,400 distinct conjugates. Generated by `source/generate.py`.

Source: ATLAS HSG1-p100B0; Aschbacher–Smith 16.1.5(10), printed p.1172;
GLS3, Table 5.3m.
-/

